flowchart LR
  JobFail[SQL Agent job failed] --> MonitorCheck[Monitor detects failed job]
  MonitorCheck -->|Call| usp_LogAndCheckSystemAlert[Stored procedure: usp_LogAndCheckSystemAlert]
  usp_LogAndCheckSystemAlert -->|returns| decision{AlertShouldBeSent?}
  decision -- yes --> Email[emailService.sendEmail()]
  decision -- yes --> Teams[notificationService.sendTeamsAlert()]
  decision -- yes --> FrontendUpdate[SocketIO emit to subscribers]
  decision -- no --> LoggedOnly[Only logged - no notify]
